Playback controls
-------|--------------------------------------
.      | Step forward
,      | Step backward
j or J | Cycle through the available subtitles
< or > | Go backward/forward in the playlist.
s      | Take screenshot
q      | Quit
Q      | Quit and save current playback position

UI controls
-------|--------------------------------------
c      | Change visualization (audio only)
T      | Toggle stay-on-top

Looping controls
-------|--------------------------------------
l      | Set/clear A-B loop points
L      | Toggle infinite looping

